
Short:    SentBy v1.2 for FAME 1.1+.
Author:   strider@deadline.snafu.de (David Wettig)
Uploader: strider@deadline.snafu.de (David Wettig)
Type:     comm/bbs

SentBy is an autorun executable for FAMEFileChecker to add the SentBy lines
on background file id extraction under the usage of the Sent.Dat file from
the FileId Door from ByteAndi/(tRSi/F-iNNOVATiON).
Source now also reads 'CONFPATH/K/A' argument from FAMEFileChecker v1.10+.
